                        "form": "дра́йверах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f70fa17-1e3a-3dea-8e4e-7d966658f3b0",
                        "entry_id": "52786f09-a974-38a2-bfad-41d326c6d735",
                        "glosses": [
                            "экон. определяющий, ведущий фактор"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0fc6baf-fb74-4c8a-984f-480f940b7fee",
                                "sense_id": "3f70fa17-1e3a-3dea-8e4e-7d966658f3b0",
                                "text": "Но именно предстоящая Олимпиада — ключевой драйвер роста рынка гостиничной недвижимости на Черноморском побережье."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5828c9d2-5270-315b-ac45-ecbc4b90b2db",
                        "entry_id": "52786f09-a974-38a2-bfad-41d326c6d735",
                        "glosses": [
                            "комп. программа, управляющая аппаратным обеспечением, выдающая себя за аппаратное обеспечение, обеспечивающая связь между программами по стандартному интерфейсу"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b4fcd77-c9f3-40f6-807a-90ae3ad4e530",
                                "sense_id": "5828c9d2-5270-315b-ac45-ecbc4b90b2db",
                                "text": "На скриншоте выше изображен яркий пример проблемы с драйверами. В вашем случае такая история будет с вкладкой «Клавиатуры». // В этой ситуации нужно произвести установку или переустановку драйверов клавиатуры, если они некорректно установлены."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67463420-41e0-4a1c-9a69-73fb72c0ef09",
                                "sense_id": "5828c9d2-5270-315b-ac45-ecbc4b90b2db",
                                "text": "Доступ из программы к базе данных осуществляется через интерфейс Open Database Connectivity (ODBC) с использованием объектов MFC классов CDatabase и CRecordset, что в принципе позволяет в качестве хранилища исходных данных использовать любую СУБД, для которой существует ODBC-драйвер."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33aaaba1-f815-464b-929a-07643de1f241",
                                "sense_id": "5828c9d2-5270-315b-ac45-ecbc4b90b2db",
                                "text": "Программный драйвер низкого уровня следит за состоянием управляющих сигналов и обрабатывает все запросы ЧПУ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9c7e5fe-d852-43ac-a53c-bc7a7bd25511",
                                "sense_id": "5828c9d2-5270-315b-ac45-ecbc4b90b2db",
                                "text": "У твоего компа негодные драйвера, // А у моего компа вообще драйверов пас…"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8da0817d-0107-3a05-bd83-e021fa338307",
                        "entry_id": "52786f09-a974-38a2-bfad-41d326c6d735",
                        "glosses": [
                            "эл.-техн. управляемый источник питания, предназначенный для дозированной подачи тока на электромоторы, светодиоды и т. д."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "365b4580-518e-4ebc-aad5-8463ac810f49",
                                "sense_id": "8da0817d-0107-3a05-bd83-e021fa338307",
                                "text": "Электромотор подключен к контроллеру движения с помощью драйвера"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d85ac369-73de-30a4-83a2-5dcdd8b9de0a",
                        "entry_id": "52786f09-a974-38a2-bfad-41d326c6d735",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жарг. водитель автомобиля, таксист"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a720a58-ddc4-4f56-8682-363ff28504ed",
                                "sense_id": "d85ac369-73de-30a4-83a2-5dcdd8b9de0a",
                                "text": "Есть такой негласный порядок, по которому драйвер может лезть с расспросами о самом сокровенном (что он обычно и делает — с превеликим удовольствием), а «стопщику» со своим любопытством навязываться не следует."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9f46754-ba19-427f-a326-654bcfb77a65",
                                "sense_id": "d85ac369-73de-30a4-83a2-5dcdd8b9de0a",
                                "text": "Наш, с виду неказистый драйвер, искусно лавируя внутри достаточно плотного потока машин, за каких-то шесть минут догнал искомую транспортную единицу."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "545fa89b-1059-481b-98c8-a937eb7a694f",
                                "sense_id": "d85ac369-73de-30a4-83a2-5dcdd8b9de0a",
                                "text": "Мама однажды не выдержала и забросала машину с балкона помидорами (такие красные земляные фрукты, мокрые внутри), предположительный Петров не вышел, но зато выскочил его драйвер и начал нецензурно обижаться на маму."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eab0927a-38ef-4974-95fd-1fbd2a946747",
                        "source_entry_id": "52786f09-a974-38a2-bfad-41d326c6d735",
                        "source_sense_description": "компьютерная программа",
                        "target_lang_word": "device driver",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "device driver",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3835fcd-13fc-3623-8ce3-97f039b8f562",
                                        "entry_id": "9507d775-b5d1-349c-af14-bfb47e79f8e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Software, usually supplied with the operating system or by a hardware manufacturer, that communicates between the operating system of a personal computer and a specific hardware device."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4a43d29-ef18-4a20-a9d6-860cbcb91b5c",
                                                "sense_id": "b3835fcd-13fc-3623-8ce3-97f039b8f562",
                                                "text": "The identity of the device driver process is returned by the process manager to the file manager[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b36b8ea-d5c3-4eda-be48-cd28fabce9f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "52786f09-a974-38a2-bfad-41d326c6d735",
                        "source_sense_description": "компьютерная программа",
                        "target_lang_word": "software driver",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b26b992c-f846-40cc-a651-3e57a9946d9d",
                        "source_entry_id": "52786f09-a974-38a2-bfad-41d326c6d735",
                        "source_sense_description": "водитель транспорта",
                        "target_lang_word": "driver",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "driver",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7be12f1-f495-3697-a335-b360e8de1738",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drives something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af4b279f-791f-4367-9571-14a34e0da499",
                                                "sense_id": "b7be12f1-f495-3697-a335-b360e8de1738",
                                                "text": "Luke North was working in the North East District when Harry Patterson the pony driver came by. It was 5.45 o'clock. Luke smelt danger in the air. He walked round the pony to speak with Harry […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drives something.",
                                            "A person who drives a motorized vehicle such as a car, truck, bus, train, forklift, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6df3521-6c1f-4a5f-856f-d8578339c7c9",
                                                "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                                "text": "The driver will make an announcement when the trip is nearing its completion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91315f68-dc0d-414b-bea5-92a655a4cb3c",
                                                "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                                "text": "Tipping your driver is optional but is much appreciated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4648b252-0c15-45e4-aad2-9066894920f8",
                                                "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                                "text": "That’s nearly twice the highest posted speed limit in the United States, 85 mph, on a stretch of highway in Texas. Why do our speedometers stretch to a speed that’s illegal, and only race-car drivers will ever reach?\nToyota spokesman Paul Hogard said the automaker wants speedometers to be easy to read, so there’s value in placing the typical operating speed of American cars, 45 mph to 70 mph, he said, at the top of the speedometer, which is the easiest place on the speedometer for the driver to read."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b0967a4-24f3-4d7d-8bc9-f66adb1bcce3",
                                                "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                                "text": "Earlier this month, the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration began an investigation into four crashes of Teslas operating with a partial-automation system (which can navigate highways and steer the car on city streets but requires a licensed driver to be present), including one in which a pedestrian was killed. In a news release, NHTSA said reduced visibility may have led to the crashes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fd06985-c3dd-3722-b7c6-fc07560ac14f",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drives something.",
                                            "A pilot (person who flies aircraft)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70759870-c452-3c41-a1de-436e66481b75",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drives something.",
                                            "A person who drives livestock: a drover."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8f4c7a5-aaa3-41a6-a140-bc45e9e3e980",
                                                "sense_id": "70759870-c452-3c41-a1de-436e66481b75",
                                                "text": "Up until 1872 there was not over 150 miles of railroad in the state [Texas], that was from Galveston to Houston, and a short line from Houston to Brazoria, twenty-five miles in length, and one road from Harrisburg to Alton, three miles east of Columbus. So the cattle driving to Kansas was the only hope at that time, and it proved to be a great help before the railroads got around. Trail driving to Kansas lasted from 1866 to 1886 and it was estimated that fully eight million head of cattle and horses were driven and sold during the twenty years above mentioned to Kansas, the drivers paying for the cattle on an average of $10.00 per head, although most of the horses came back to Texas and were used the next year. There were all sizes of herds from five hundred to twenty-five hundred cattle in a drove, usually seven or eight men to the small herds and twelve to fifteen men with the large herds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1bed48ee-8313-39cb-867a-535a87b25d71",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60619b33-35b4-41e1-a0a4-bbf8e4797fe8",
                                                "sense_id": "1bed48ee-8313-39cb-867a-535a87b25d71",
                                                "text": "The character of work is a driver of social change, at the same time that any new forms of work are the result of broader social change."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6a05f6f-c146-490f-8a34-d91fd7f5f54e",
                                                "sense_id": "1bed48ee-8313-39cb-867a-535a87b25d71",
                                                "text": "The aim is to secure up to £140 million for the combined road and rail improvements, including a new road bridge to replace a level crossing at Totton. A key driver has been the approval of a new housing and employment development called Fawley Waterside, with 1,500 homes planned on the site of a redundant power station on the edge of Southampton Water."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
